WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:03.820
Every lottery has the same problem.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.940
Someone holds the jar.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.500
And you just… trust them.

4
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:12.510
So we built Lotry on Bitcoin Cash,

5
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.370
where the jar is a coin with no key.

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.880
Nobody can open it.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.780
Not the players.

8
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.100
Not even me, the organiser.

9
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.900
So you buy a ticket,

10
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.680
and it's a real NFT in your own wallet.

11
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.100
When the round ends, sales close.

12
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.140
Then I reveal a secret

13
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.180
that I locked in at the start,

14
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.700
and the blockchain itself picks the winner.

15
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.750
The winner burns their ticket

16
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.010
and takes the whole pot.

17
00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.510
And if I disappear, or nobody claims?

18
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:46.770
Everyone gets their money back.

19
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.430
It's live on Bitcoin Cash's test network,

20
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.450
and you can play it,

21
00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.990
and try to cheat it, in your browser.

22
00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:56.600
Lotry.

23
00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.720
The lottery the organiser can't run away with.
